    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39776" root="نشب" body-key="n">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْشَبْتُهُ فِيهِ</span></b> , (S, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَشَّبْتُهُ</span></b> , (K,) <i>I
made it to stick fast in it,</i> (S,) <i>so that it would
not pass through.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انشب</span> <i>He</i> (a fowler
or the like) <i>had game caught,</i> or <i>entangled, in
his snare,</i> or <i>net.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>He</i> (a hawk)
<i>fixed</i> his talons into his prey. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انشبتِ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرِّيحُ</span> <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انسبت</span>, <i>The wind was violent, and
drove along the dust and pebbles.</i> (K.)

